WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.307 --> 00:00:02.025
- Nowadays, I smoke about a pack a month.

00:00:02.025 --> 00:00:03.023
- I smoke two packs a day.

00:00:03.023 --> 00:00:04.440
- If I'm working both
jobs in the same day,

00:00:04.440 --> 00:00:06.645
then it can be like three or four.

00:00:06.645 --> 00:00:09.403
If I'm drinking, then like five or six.

00:00:14.726 --> 00:00:17.117
- Been smoking since I
was probably fifteen?

00:00:17.117 --> 00:00:18.789
- I started smoking
because I was in a play.

00:00:18.789 --> 00:00:21.134
My excuse was method acting, but deep down

00:00:21.134 --> 00:00:23.131
I really wanted to just
try smoking cigarettes.

00:00:23.131 --> 00:00:25.894
- I went to college and started drinking

00:00:25.894 --> 00:00:27.844
and just had an occasional cigarette

00:00:27.844 --> 00:00:30.672
while drinking and it took me here.

00:00:40.940 --> 00:00:42.612
- I know smoking's bad for me.

00:00:42.612 --> 00:00:44.005
It's probably something that I

00:00:44.005 --> 00:00:46.304
want to quit eventually but it's

00:00:46.304 --> 00:00:47.813
a lot easier said than done.

00:00:47.813 --> 00:00:51.133
- [Meredith] I've quit for, a
few times, a couple weeks tops

00:00:51.133 --> 00:00:53.200
and then end up just buying a pack again.

00:00:53.200 --> 00:00:54.662
- [Edd] I hope to get scared out of

00:00:54.662 --> 00:00:56.775
smoking cigarettes anymore, and finally

00:00:56.775 --> 00:00:58.076
be able to fully quit.

00:00:58.076 --> 00:00:59.190
- [Meredith] I'm upset with myself

00:00:59.190 --> 00:01:00.746
that I have decided to pick up this habit

00:01:00.746 --> 00:01:02.046
and hopefully seeing the physical

00:01:02.046 --> 00:01:04.182
changes to my face, it'll help me

00:01:04.182 --> 00:01:07.317
make a positive choice in
my life to quit smoking.

00:01:07.317 --> 00:01:08.571
- I don't think it'll change my mind,

00:01:08.571 --> 00:01:12.164
but it's worth giving it a shot.

00:01:15.885 --> 00:01:17.226
(sigh)

00:01:18.323 --> 00:01:20.291
- Aww!

00:01:20.505 --> 00:01:22.456
- Oh my god.

00:01:22.456 --> 00:01:25.985
- Oh shit, oh wow, ahh.

00:01:25.985 --> 00:01:27.982
- I'm so old.

00:01:27.982 --> 00:01:29.909
- The craziest part about
it is it doesn't look like

00:01:29.909 --> 00:01:32.625
I have makeup on, it just
looks like I'm an old man.

00:01:32.625 --> 00:01:35.522
- Ah, that's awful.

00:01:36.457 --> 00:01:37.896
- [Meredith] Lines
around the lips will make

00:01:37.896 --> 00:01:40.607
my lipstick bleed, and I
do like to wear lipstick.

00:01:40.613 --> 00:01:42.911
- [Edd] The looseness of the skin gives it

00:01:42.911 --> 00:01:46.366
a very almost frail texture.

00:01:46.673 --> 00:01:49.366
- [Michael] Well my teeth
are absolutely disgusting

00:01:49.366 --> 00:01:53.842
and I'm kind of taken
back, it's pretty bizarre.

00:01:53.894 --> 00:01:55.496
- If this is what my outside appearance

00:01:55.496 --> 00:01:57.609
looks like, just from smoking cigarettes,

00:01:57.609 --> 00:02:00.883
then I cannot even imagine
what my insides look like.

00:02:00.883 --> 00:02:02.578
- It's kinda depressing, I just, I feel

00:02:02.578 --> 00:02:04.250
like I'm an old man.

00:02:04.250 --> 00:02:06.595
- After this experience, I definitely

00:02:06.595 --> 00:02:09.822
want to cut cigarettes
out of my life completely.

00:02:09.822 --> 00:02:11.564
- I don't want to continue smoking.

00:02:11.564 --> 00:02:16.564
- I'm going to reconsider
smoking less or quitting.

00:02:16.881 --> 00:02:18.088
- Try to make sure that my body

00:02:18.088 --> 00:02:20.782
ages naturally and not super-advanced

00:02:20.782 --> 00:02:22.175
like this process shows.

00:02:22.175 --> 00:02:23.800
- A lot of people say they only smoke

00:02:23.800 --> 00:02:25.518
when they're drinking alcohol, and

00:02:25.518 --> 00:02:27.771
that's exactly how I started doing it.

00:02:27.771 --> 00:02:30.394
It can turn into a habit
that you do every day.

00:02:30.394 --> 00:02:31.950
- I still kind of really want a cigarette,

00:02:31.950 --> 00:02:34.876
which is how upsetting of a hold

00:02:34.876 --> 00:02:36.687
cigarettes can have on your life.

00:02:36.687 --> 00:02:38.446
- It's not worth it.

